# ==============================================================================
# Signalpost External Intelligence & Search Configuration (All Optional)
# By default, the agent runs at $0.00 spend on pure Brreg + DNS probing + YouTube feeds.
# Any keys provided below will be used for Google Places ratings and search fallbacks.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Serper.dev (Google Search & Google Places API) - Recommended Primary
# Used for:
#   - Google Places Ratings & Reviews (place_id, rating, review_count, address)
#   - Missing website discovery search fallback
# Free tier: 2,500 one-time queries on signup, NO credit card required.
# Signup: https://serper.dev
SERPER_API_KEY=your_serper_api_key_here

# 2. Tavily Search API (Secondary Search Fallback)
# Free tier: 1,000 queries per month, no credit card required.
# Signup: https://tavily.com
TAVILY_API_KEY=

# 3. Brave Search API (Alternative Search Fallback)
# Free tier: 2,000 queries per month, no credit card required.
# Signup: https://brave.com/search/api/
BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=

# 4. Google Custom Search JSON API (Optional)
# Free tier: 100 queries per day, no credit card required.
# Setup: https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
GOOGLE_CSE_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_CSE_CX=

# 5. Bing Web Search API v7 (Optional)
# Free tier: 1,000 queries per month on Azure Cognitive Services.
BING_SEARCH_API_KEY=

# 6. Exa.ai Search API (Optional)
# Free tier: $10 trial credit (~1,000 queries) on signup.
# Signup: https://exa.ai
EXA_API_KEY=

# Note on YouTube & NAV:
# - YouTube Buzz & Engagement: Runs keyless ($0 spend) via public channel feeds.
# - NAV Arbeidsplassen: Runs keyless ($0 spend) via public stillinger API.
